  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\r\n<head>\r\n\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\r\n<title>품목고시 인증코드- ShopLinker API Service</title>\r\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"http://apiweb.shoplinker.co.kr/ShoplinkerApi/Docs2/css/base_tmp.css\" />\r\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"http://apiweb.shoplinker.co.kr/ShoplinkerApi/Docs2/css/layout.css\" />\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<!--필드변수-->\r\n<h3 class=\"bul01\">품목고시 인증코드</h3>\r\n<table class=\"list02\">\r\n\t \t<tr>\r\n\t\t<th>인증코드 입력시 참고사항</th>\r\n\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"op_s\">*인증코드표 참조</p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t <ul class=\"op\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<li>[1]-국가통합인증(KC마크)</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li>[2]-전기용품 안전인증</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li>[3]-KPS 안전인증 표시</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li>[4]-KPS 자율안전 확인 표시</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li>[5]-KPS 어린이 보호포장 표시</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li>[6]-KCC인증</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li>[7]-MIC인증</li>\r\n\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t<br>\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"op_s\">* 인증이 1개일 경우 </p>\r\n\t\t\t <ul class=\"op\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<li>예)샵링커 인증SEQ<**>인증번호 </li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li>-> 2<**>1_전기 </li>\r\n\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t<Br>\r\n\t\t\t<p class=\"op_s\">*인증이 2개 이상일 경우 </p>\r\n\t\t\t <ul class=\"op\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<li>예)샵링커 인증SEQ<**>인증번호<<>>.. </li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li>-> 2<**>1_전기<<>>3<**>11_kps<<>>6<**>111_kcc </li>\r\n\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t</td>\r\n\t </tr>\r\n </table>\r\n</body>\r\n<SCRIPT LANGUAGE=\"JavaScript\">\tresizeTo(750,400);\r\n </script>",
